{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Interpreted the retained snapshot-delivery receipt (44629fa87bbb418b99ac46fff6cb228d) for experiment 00797d817371473babcaf5b1b7b0a7bf-experiment: all four comparisons hold with matched admissions, so the stale snapshot at index 3 exposed nothing and left the commit at 4, and the newer snapshot at index 10 was exposed at index 10 and advanced the commit to 10. Added a measured fact entry and updated the snapshot-restore interpretation with the experiment, the decisive parsed indices 1 and 3, and revised rationale, counterevidence and limitations that keep role-map replacement, the Recover task and restart recovery source-only because both snapshots carried the existing {1,2,3} membership. Validation reports valid, no_change false, execution_requested false, with a knowledge create and an interpretation append.\"}"}}
